      "options": {
        "code": { "language": "plaintext", "showLineNumbers": false, "showMiniMap": false },
        "content": "**Core · ESI rate limits** — token buckets shared with workers in **Redis** (`esi:group:*`). EVE’s error limit uses a **rolling 15 minute** window per group.\n\n**Tokens remaining** — time series. **Tokens consumed** — snapshot table (rolling window usage from Redis).\n\n**Seconds into rolling window** — time since the **oldest** consumption in the window (0→900s).\n\n**Countdown when exhausted** — only when the bucket has **no tokens left**: seconds until the **oldest** consumption drops out of the 15m window (next token available). **0** when not exhausted or not waiting.\n\nMetrics: OTLP → Prometheus **`job=otel_collector`**. Token **counts** use names **`core_esi_group_token_*`** (values are raw token counts from Redis). Aligns with collector **`translation_strategy: UnderscoreEscapingWithoutSuffixes`** (no `*_ratio` suffix).",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "",
      "transparent": true,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "description": "Tokens left in the rolling window before the limit is hit (limit − consumed when enforced).",
